# name: fx_cool_wave
# palette: c=COOL_LIGHT+COOL_BASE/170 C=COOL_HI/200
# A cold-air wave that crawls across the floor when climate turns on. The `+`
# in the palette entry is an ordered-dither blend of two ramp steps, which is
# how LVGL v9 has to express a mid tone now that gradient dithering is gone.
--frame--
..CC..
.cccc.
cc..cc
--frame--
.CC...
cccc..
c..cc.
